# Allowlist: never send local mail, credentials, caches, or the working tree to
# a remote builder. The Dockerfile copies only these package build inputs.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
!docker/
!docker/build-constraints.txt
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.[eE][mM][lL]
**/*.[mM][bB][oO][xX]
**/.env*
